      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "red pepper flakes",
      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees.",
    "Season the chicken breast with salt and pepper.",
    "Sear the chicken breast in a skillet until browned on both sides.",
    "Transfer the chicken to a baking sheet and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "In the same skillet, add the arborio rice and cook until lightly toasted.",
    "Add the heavy cream, yuzu juice, and yuzu zest to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook until the liquid is mostly absorbed.",
    "Stir in the parmesan cheese, thyme, and red pepper flakes.",
    "Spoon the risotto into ramekins and top with sliced chicken breast.",
    "Serve immediately."
  ],
